### UStudent API - Student Profile Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Get Student 1 Profile (John Smith - CS Sophomore)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/profile

### Get Student 2 Profile (Jane Doe - Math Freshman)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/profile

### Test Invalid Student ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/999/profile